<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Haphazard — Signal Console</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#080b0d;color:#e8edf0;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.55;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(94,255,170,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(94,255,170,.025) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:32px 32px}.wrap{width:min(1240px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto}.top{height:62px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #2a3338;font-size:.75rem}.top b{font-size:1rem;color:#72ffad}.top .right{text-align:right;color:#809099}.lights{display:flex;gap:6px}.lights i{display:block;width:7px;height:7px;background:#72ffad;box-shadow:0 0 10px #72ffad}.hero{padding:72px 0 58px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.35fr .65fr;gap:60px}.status{color:#72ffad;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.16em}.hero h1{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(4.4rem,10vw,9.4rem);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin:32px 0 28px;max-width:9ch}.hero h1 span{color:#72ffad}.hero p{color:#95a3aa;max-width:62ch;font-size:1.05rem}.command{align-self:end;border:1px solid #39454b;background:#0d1215;padding:18px;box-shadow:inset 3px 0 #72ffad}.command small{color:#66747a}.command p{margin:8px 0 0;color:#d9e1e5}.prompt{color:#72ffad}.run{margin-top:18px;background:#72ffad;color:#031109;border:0;padding:10px 14px;font:800 .74rem ui-monospace,monospace;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}.metrics{border-top:1px solid #2a3338;border-bottom:1px solid #2a3338;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.metric{padding:24px;border-right:1px solid #2a3338}.metric:last-child{border:0}.metric span{display:block;color:#75848a;font-size:.66rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em}.metric b{font:500 1.55rem Arial,sans-serif}.work{padding:66px 0 110px}.work-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:22px}.work h2{font:800 3rem Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:0}.filters{display:flex;gap:5px}.filters button{background:#101619;color:#7f8e94;border:1px solid #2f393e;padding:8px 10px;font:inherit;font-size:.7rem;cursor:pointer}.filters button.active,.filters button:hover{color:#72ffad;border-color:#72ffad}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}.card{display:block;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid #2b353a;background:#0c1114;padding:26px;min-height:250px;position:relative;transition:.18s}.card:hover{border-color:#72ffad;transform:translateY(-2px)}.card .id{color:#65747b;font-size:.66rem}.card h3{font:800 2.3rem Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:45px 0 10px}.card p{color:#87969c;max-width:50ch}.tags{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:absolute;left:26px;bottom:24px}.tags span{border:1px solid #344147;padding:4px 7px;color:#8fa0a7;font-size:.62rem}.arrow{position:absolute;right:24px;top:20px;color:#72ffad}.toast{position:fixed;right:18px;bottom:18px;background:#72ffad;color:#041109;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:800;font-size:.75rem;transform:translateY(150%);transition:.25s}.toast.show{transform:translateY(0)}footer{border-top:1px solid #2a3338;padding:24px 0 60px;color:#637279;font-size:.7rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}@media(max-width:750px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,18vw,6rem)}.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.work-head{align-items:start;gap:20px;flex-direction:column}.top{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.lights{display:none}}
</style></head><body><header class="top wrap"><b>~/haphazard.dev</b><div class="lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="right">SYSTEMS ONLINE · 04 PROJECTS</div></header><main><section class="hero wrap"><div><div class="status">● Independent tools / active experiments</div><h1>Less ceremony.<br><span>Better leverage.</span></h1><p>Developer tools that compress multi-repo work, editor friction, and agent orchestration into simpler, faster moves.</p></div><div class="command"><small>haphazard — current mission</small><p><span class="prompt">❯</span> remove friction from high-context work</p><button class="run">Run principle</button></div></section><section class="metrics"><div class="metric"><span>focus</span><b>workflow leverage</b></div><div class="metric"><span>habitat</span><b>terminal + editor</b></div><div class="metric"><span>method</span><b>ship → learn</b></div><div class="metric"><span>status</span><b>deliberately useful</b></div></section><section class="work wrap"><div class="work-head"><div><div class="status">./projects</div><h2>Current systems</h2></div><div class="filters"><button class="active" data-filter="all">ALL</button><button data-filter="cli">CLI</button><button data-filter="editor">EDITOR</button><button data-filter="agent">AGENT</button></div></div><div class="grid"><a class="card" data-kind="cli" href="https://arashi.haphazard.dev"><span class="id">SYS_001 / CLI</span><span class="arrow">↗</span><h3>Arashi</h3><p>Coordinate worktrees across many repositories as one aligned workspace.</p><div class="tags"><span>TYPESCRIPT</span><span>GIT</span><span>NODE</span></div></a><a class="card" data-kind="editor" href="https://github.com/corwinm/oil.code"><span class="id">SYS_002 / EDITOR</span><span class="arrow">↗</span><h3>oil.code</h3><p>Edit the filesystem as text without breaking your keyboard-first flow.</p><div class="tags"><span>VSCODE</span><span>FILESYSTEM</span></div></a><a class="card" data-kind="agent" href="https://github.com/corwinm/coding-agents-tmux"><span class="id">SYS_003 / AGENT</span><span class="arrow">↗</span><h3>coding-agents-tmux</h3><p>Track, inspect, and jump between many coding-agent sessions.</p><div class="tags"><span>TMUX</span><span>AGENTS</span></div></a><a class="card" data-kind="agent" href="https://github.com/HaphazardDev/pi-extensions"><span class="id">SYS_004 / AGENT</span><span class="arrow">↗</span><h3>pi extensions</h3><p>Focused extensions that improve the daily ergonomics of pi.</p><div class="tags"><span>PI</span><span>EXPERIMENTS</span></div></a></div></section></main><footer class="wrap"><span>HAPHAZARD.DEV / CORWIN MARSH</span><span>BUILD SMALL. COMPOUND THE LEVERAGE.</span></footer><div class="toast">PRINCIPLE EXECUTED: one rough edge removed.</div><script>document.querySelector('.run').onclick=()=>{const t=document.querySelector('.toast');t.classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>t.classList.remove('show'),2200)};document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('active'));b.classList.add('active');document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(c=>c.style.display=b.dataset.filter==='all'||c.dataset.kind===b.dataset.filter?'block':'none')})</script></body></html>